1 New deck skeleton
Per-file header. Everything not listed inherits from _quarto.yml.
---
title: "Deck title"
format:
  revealjs:
    transition: fade        # override only if needed
    scrollable: false       # true = every slide gets a scrollbar
    navigation-mode: linear # linear | vertical | grid
---
